Package: gptread
Title: Fine-Grained Control Over How LLMs Ingest, Segment, and Read Documents
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Justin", "Chase", email = "jchase.msu@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Author: Justin Chase [aut, cre, cph]
Maintainer: Justin Chase <jchase.msu@gmail.com>
Description: A composable framework for document question answering with large
    language models. Ingestion (extraction and cleaning), segmentation
    (chunking), and reading (answering strategy) are three independent,
    pluggable axes. Every stage is configurable, every stage is inspectable via
    a structured run trace, and every stage is registry-based so users can add
    their own extractors, cleaners, segmenters, and readers without editing the
    package.
URL: https://github.com/elkronos/gpt_read
BugReports: https://github.com/elkronos/gpt_read/issues
